{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52981","headline":"故功德使凉国公李将军挽歌词二首 二 · 赵迁","name":"故功德使凉国公李将军挽歌词二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大树悲风起，将军去不回。\n抚棺心益痛，临穴泪难裁。\n晓月繁霜草，幽泉掩夜台。\n更闻歌伴哭，触物尽成哀。\n（见《大正新修大藏经》第五十二册释圆照集《代宗朝赠司空大辨正广智三藏和上〖即不空〗表制集》卷五）（按：二诗题下署「前左领军卫兵曹参军翰林待诏赵迁」。\n同书卷六有同人大历十一年《贺平李灵曜表》。\n同人撰《不空行状》见《大正新修大藏经》卷四十九册。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵迁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}